Package: MiraMR
Title: Mira's Mendelian Randomization Toolkit
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mira's Father", "Developer", email = "mtmmu88@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "Dedicated to my daughter Mira")
Description: A comprehensive Mendelian Randomization (MR) analysis toolkit
    designed for academic research and educational purposes. Provides intuitive
    functions for univariate and multivariate MR analysis, Summary-based MR (SMR),
    omics data integration (inflammatory factors, immune cells, metabolomics,
    gut microbiome), GWAS meta-analysis, and pleiotropic analysis. All functions
    use the 'mira_' prefix for easy discovery and to honor the package's namesake.
    For academic use only - not for unauthorized commercial purposes.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/mtmmu88/MiraMR
